{"seq":2,"slug":"effect-handlers","title":"效果处理器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/concurrency-effects/effect-handlers","wordCount":919,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"效果处理器\">效果处理器</h1><p>Effect Handler（效果处理器）是 OCaml 5 引入的可组合控制流机制——它将「执行效果」与「处理效果的策略」解耦，使得异步 IO、异常、状态、日志、协程等行为可以被模块化地定义和组合。OCaml 5.5 进一步为 effect handler 引入了专用语法（<code>effect</code> 关键字），使其从「高级特性」逐步走向日常工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-perform-与-handler\">核心概念：perform 与 handler</h2><p>Effect Handler 的工作模式类似于异常，但有一个关键区别——异常展开栈后无法返回，而 effect handler 可以恢复被暂停的计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"open Effect&#10;open Effect.Deep&#10;&#10;(* 1. 声明效果 *)&#10;type _ Effect.t += Ask : string Effect.t&#10;type _ Effect.t += Log : string -&gt; unit Effect.t&#10;&#10;(* 2. 执行计算，perform 效果 *)&#10;let greet () =&#10;  let name = perform Ask in&#10;  perform (Log (&quot;Greeting &quot; ^ name));&#10;  &quot;Hello, &quot; ^ name ^ &quot;!&quot;&#10;&#10;(* 3. 安装 handler，决定如何处理效果 *)&#10;let run_greet () =&#10;  match_with greet ()&#10;    { retc = (fun result -&gt; result);&#10;      exnc = (fun exn -&gt; raise exn);&#10;      effc = fun (type a) (eff : a Effect.t) -&gt;&#10;        match eff with&#10;        | Ask -&gt; Some (fun (k : (a, _) continuation) -&gt;&#10;            continue k &quot;World&quot;)&#10;        | Log msg -&gt; Some (fun (k : (a, _) continuation) -&gt;&#10;            Printf.printf &quot;[LOG] %s\\n&quot; msg;&#10;            continue k ())&#10;        | _ -&gt; None }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>open Effect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>open Effect.Deep</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 1. 声明效果 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type _ Effect.t += Ask : string Effect.t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type _ Effect.t += Log : string -> unit Effect.t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 2. 执行计算，perform 效果 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let greet () =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let name = perform Ask in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  perform (Log (\"Greeting \" ^ name));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"Hello, \" ^ name ^ \"!\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 3. 安装 handler，决定如何处理效果 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let run_greet () =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match_with greet ()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { retc = (fun result -> result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      exnc = (fun exn -> raise exn);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      effc = fun (type a) (eff : a Effect.t) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        match eff with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        | Ask -> Some (fun (k : (a, _) continuation) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            continue k \"World\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        | Log msg -> Some (fun (k : (a, _) continuation) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Printf.printf \"[LOG] %s\\n\" msg;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            continue k ())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        | _ -> None }</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>continue k value</code> 是关键操作——它将 <code>value</code> 作为 <code>perform</code> 表达式的返回值，恢复暂停的计算。这使得 effect handler 本质上是一种 delimited continuation（分界续延）机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"深处理器与浅处理器\">深处理器与浅处理器</h2><p>OCaml 提供两种 handler 语义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* Deep handler：递归处理后续 perform *)&#10;(* 一次安装，处理计算中所有同类效果 *)&#10;let count_asks computation =&#10;  let counter = ref 0 in&#10;  match_with computation ()&#10;    { retc = (fun result -&gt; (result, !counter));&#10;      exnc = raise;&#10;      effc = fun (type a) (eff : a Effect.t) -&gt;&#10;        match eff with&#10;        | Ask -&gt; Some (fun (k : (a, _) continuation) -&gt;&#10;            incr counter;&#10;            continue k &quot;default&quot;)&#10;        | _ -&gt; None }&#10;&#10;(* Shallow handler：只处理第一次 perform，后续需重新安装 *)&#10;let step_by_step computation =&#10;  Effect.Shallow.match_with computation ()&#10;    { retc = (fun result -&gt; `Done result);&#10;      exnc = (fun exn -&gt; `Error exn);&#10;      effc = fun (type a) (eff : a Effect.t) -&gt;&#10;        match eff with&#10;        | Ask -&gt; Some (fun (k : (a, _) Effect.Shallow.continuation) -&gt;&#10;            `Suspended (k, &quot;provide a value&quot;))&#10;        | _ -&gt; None }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* Deep handler：递归处理后续 perform *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 一次安装，处理计算中所有同类效果 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let count_asks computation =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let counter = ref 0 in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match_with computation ()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { retc = (fun result -> (result, !counter));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      exnc = raise;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      effc = fun (type a) (eff : a Effect.t) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        match eff with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        | Ask -> Some (fun (k : (a, _) continuation) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            incr counter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            continue k \"default\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        | _ -> None }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* Shallow handler：只处理第一次 perform，后续需重新安装 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let step_by_step computation =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Effect.Shallow.match_with computation ()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { retc = (fun result -> `Done result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      exnc = (fun exn -> `Error exn);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      effc = fun (type a) (eff : a Effect.t) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        match eff with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        | Ask -> Some (fun (k : (a, _) Effect.Shallow.continuation) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            `Suspended (k, \"provide a value\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        | _ -> None }</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Deep Handler</th>\n<th>Shallow Handler</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>处理范围</td>\n<td>计算中所有同类效果</td>\n<td>仅第一次 perform</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>续延重用</td>\n<td>handler 自动重装</td>\n<td>需手动 <code>continue_with</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>略高（内部优化）</td>\n<td>更灵活但多一次间接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>日志、状态、IO 解释</td>\n<td>协程、单步调试器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 计算&#10;    participant H as Handler&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;H: perform Ask&#10;    Note over C: 计算暂停&#10;    H-&gt;&gt;H: 决定返回值&#10;    H-&gt;&gt;C: continue k &quot;World&quot;&#10;    Note over C: 计算恢复&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;H: perform (Log msg)&#10;    Note over C: 计算再次暂停&#10;    H-&gt;&gt;H: 打印日志&#10;    H-&gt;&gt;C: continue k ()&#10;    Note over C: 计算继续到结束&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;H: 返回最终结果\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 计算\n    participant H as Handler\n    C-&gt;&gt;H: perform Ask\n    Note over C: 计算暂停\n    H-&gt;&gt;H: 决定返回值\n    H-&gt;&gt;C: continue k \"World\"\n    Note over C: 计算恢复\n    C-&gt;&gt;H: perform (Log msg)\n    Note over C: 计算再次暂停\n    H-&gt;&gt;H: 打印日志\n    H-&gt;&gt;C: continue k ()\n    Note over C: 计算继续到结束\n    C-&gt;&gt;H: 返回最终结果</pre><h2 id=\"ocaml-5-5-的-effect-语法\">OCaml 5.5 的 effect 语法</h2><p>OCaml 5.5 引入了 <code>effect</code> 关键字和专用的匹配语法，减少样板代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* 新语法——直接在 match 中处理效果 *)&#10;let run_with_state init computation =&#10;  let state = ref init in&#10;  match computation () with&#10;  | result -&gt; (result, !state)&#10;  | effect (Get, k) -&gt; continue k !state&#10;  | effect (Set new_val, k) -&gt;&#10;    state := new_val;&#10;    continue k ()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* 新语法——直接在 match 中处理效果 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let run_with_state init computation =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let state = ref init in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match computation () with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | result -> (result, !state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | effect (Get, k) -> continue k !state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | effect (Set new_val, k) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    state := new_val;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    continue k ()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对比旧语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* 旧语法——通过 match_with 和记录 *)&#10;let run_with_state_old init computation =&#10;  let state = ref init in&#10;  match_with computation ()&#10;    { retc = (fun result -&gt; (result, !state));&#10;      exnc = raise;&#10;      effc = fun (type a) (eff : a Effect.t) -&gt;&#10;        match eff with&#10;        | Get -&gt; Some (fun (k : (a, _) continuation) -&gt; continue k !state)&#10;        | Set v -&gt; Some (fun (k : (a, _) continuation) -&gt;&#10;            state := v; continue k ())&#10;        | _ -&gt; None }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* 旧语法——通过 match_with 和记录 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let run_with_state_old init computation =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let state = ref init in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match_with computation ()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { retc = (fun result -> (result, !state));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      exnc = raise;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      effc = fun (type a) (eff : a Effect.t) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        match eff with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        | Get -> Some (fun (k : (a, _) continuation) -> continue k !state)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        | Set v -> Some (fun (k : (a, _) continuation) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            state := v; continue k ())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        | _ -> None }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>新 <code>effect</code> 关键字是上下文相关的——只在 <code>match</code> 的分支位置有效，不会破坏已有代码中将 <code>effect</code> 用作标识符的情况。通过 <code>-keywords</code> 编译器选项可以在需要时禁用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"效果的组合性\">效果的组合性</h2><p>Effect Handler 的核心优势在于可组合性——不同的效果可以由不同的 handler 独立处理，嵌套安装：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type _ Effect.t += State_get : int Effect.t&#10;type _ Effect.t += State_set : int -&gt; unit Effect.t&#10;type _ Effect.t += Emit : string -&gt; unit Effect.t&#10;&#10;let computation () =&#10;  let x = perform State_get in&#10;  perform (Emit (Printf.sprintf &quot;Current: %d&quot; x));&#10;  perform (State_set (x + 1));&#10;  perform State_get&#10;&#10;(* 独立安装每个效果的 handler *)&#10;let with_state init f =&#10;  let state = ref init in&#10;  match f () with&#10;  | x -&gt; x&#10;  | effect (State_get, k) -&gt; continue k !state&#10;  | effect (State_set v, k) -&gt; state := v; continue k ()&#10;&#10;let with_logging f =&#10;  match f () with&#10;  | x -&gt; x&#10;  | effect (Emit msg, k) -&gt;&#10;    Printf.printf &quot;[%s] %s\\n&quot; (timestamp ()) msg;&#10;    continue k ()&#10;&#10;(* 组合：handler 嵌套安装 *)&#10;let result = with_logging (fun () -&gt; with_state 0 computation)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type _ Effect.t += State_get : int Effect.t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type _ Effect.t += State_set : int -> unit Effect.t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type _ Effect.t += Emit : string -> unit Effect.t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let computation () =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let x = perform State_get in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  perform (Emit (Printf.sprintf \"Current: %d\" x));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  perform (State_set (x + 1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  perform State_get</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 独立安装每个效果的 handler *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let with_state init f =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let state = ref init in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match f () with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | x -> x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | effect (State_get, k) -> continue k !state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | effect (State_set v, k) -> state := v; continue k ()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let with_logging f =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match f () with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | x -> x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | effect (Emit msg, k) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Printf.printf \"[%s] %s\\n\" (timestamp ()) msg;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    continue k ()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 组合：handler 嵌套安装 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let result = with_logging (fun () -> with_state 0 computation)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个 handler 只关心自己负责的效果，对其他效果透明地传递——这实现了关注点的完全分离。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实现协程与生成器\">实现协程与生成器</h2><p>Effect Handler 可以直接实现协程和生成器模式，无需语言级特殊支持：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type _ Effect.t += Yield : int -&gt; unit Effect.t&#10;&#10;let generator (body : (int -&gt; unit) -&gt; unit) : unit -&gt; int option =&#10;  let continuation = ref None in&#10;  fun () -&gt;&#10;    match !continuation with&#10;    | None -&gt;&#10;      (match body (fun v -&gt; perform (Yield v)) with&#10;       | () -&gt; None&#10;       | effect (Yield v, k) -&gt;&#10;         continuation := Some k; Some v)&#10;    | Some k -&gt;&#10;      (match continue k () with&#10;       | () -&gt; continuation := None; None&#10;       | effect (Yield v, k) -&gt;&#10;         continuation := Some k; Some v)&#10;&#10;let fibonacci =&#10;  generator (fun yield -&gt;&#10;    let rec fib a b =&#10;      yield a;&#10;      fib b (a + b)&#10;    in&#10;    fib 0 1)&#10;&#10;(* fibonacci () =&gt; Some 0 *)&#10;(* fibonacci () =&gt; Some 1 *)&#10;(* fibonacci () =&gt; Some 1 *)&#10;(* fibonacci () =&gt; Some 2 *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type _ Effect.t += Yield : int -> unit Effect.t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let generator (body : (int -> unit) -> unit) : unit -> int option =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let continuation = ref None in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fun () -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match !continuation with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | None -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (match body (fun v -> perform (Yield v)) with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       | () -> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       | effect (Yield v, k) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         continuation := Some k; Some v)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    | Some k -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (match continue k () with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       | () -> continuation := None; None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       | effect (Yield v, k) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         continuation := Some k; Some v)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let fibonacci =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  generator (fun yield -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let rec fib a b =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      yield a;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      fib b (a + b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fib 0 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* fibonacci () => Some 0 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* fibonacci () => Some 1 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* fibonacci () => Some 1 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* fibonacci () => Some 2 *)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"discontinue-中止计算\">discontinue：中止计算</h2><p>除了 <code>continue</code>（恢复计算），handler 还可以 <code>discontinue</code>（通过异常中止计算）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"type _ Effect.t += Timeout_check : unit Effect.t&#10;&#10;let with_timeout duration f =&#10;  let start = Unix.gettimeofday () in&#10;  match f () with&#10;  | x -&gt; Ok x&#10;  | effect (Timeout_check, k) -&gt;&#10;    if Unix.gettimeofday () -. start &gt; duration then&#10;      discontinue k (Failure &quot;timeout&quot;)&#10;    else&#10;      continue k ()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type _ Effect.t += Timeout_check : unit Effect.t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let with_timeout duration f =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let start = Unix.gettimeofday () in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match f () with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | x -> Ok x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | effect (Timeout_check, k) -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if Unix.gettimeofday () -. start > duration then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      discontinue k (Failure \"timeout\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      continue k ()</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>discontinue k exn</code> 使得 <code>perform</code> 的调用点抛出 <code>exn</code>——暂停的计算可以通过常规的 <code>try...with</code> 处理这个异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"effect-handler-与其他控制流机制的关系\">Effect Handler 与其他控制流机制的关系</h2><p>Effect Handler 是比异常、Promise、async/await 更基础的控制流原语——后者都可以用 Effect Handler 实现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>用 Effect Handler 实现</th>\n<th>核心操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异常</td>\n<td><code>discontinue k exn</code></td>\n<td>非本地退出，不可恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协程</td>\n<td><code>continue k ()</code> + yield</td>\n<td>暂停/恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>async/await</td>\n<td><code>continue k result</code> + IO 调度</td>\n<td>非阻塞等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态 Monad</td>\n<td><code>continue k !state</code></td>\n<td>隐式状态传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非确定性</td>\n<td>分叉 continuation</td>\n<td>多路搜索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Effect Handler 是可恢复的控制流</strong>：与异常不同，<code>continue k value</code> 能把结果送回暂停点并恢复计算，本质是 delimited continuation。</li>\n<li><strong>Deep 与 Shallow 是两种安装语义</strong>：Deep handler 一次安装即递归处理后续同类效果，适合日志/状态/IO 解释；Shallow handler 只处理第一次 perform，适合协程与单步调试器。</li>\n<li><strong>OCaml 5.5 的 <code>effect</code> 语法减少样板</strong>：可直接在 <code>match</code> 分支中处理效果，且它是上下文相关的关键字，不会破坏既有代码。</li>\n<li><strong>可组合性是核心优势</strong>：每个 handler 只关心自己负责的效果，嵌套安装即实现关注点的完全分离。</li>\n<li><strong>它能统一描述多种控制流</strong>：异常（<code>discontinue k exn</code>）、协程（<code>continue k ()</code> + yield）、async/await（<code>continue k result</code> + IO 调度）、状态 Monad、非确定性都可用它实现。</li>\n<li><strong>它是 Eio 的底座</strong>：Eio 之所以能把 IO 当作普通函数调用，正是因为「IO 操作只是一种效果、调度器只是一个 handler」，而每次 <code>perform</code> 暂停的底层支撑是 Fiber。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套机制把「执行效果」与「处理效果的策略」彻底解耦，是 OCaml 5 控制流抽象的统一底层。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"效果处理器","id":"效果处理器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：perform 与 handler","id":"核心概念-perform-与-handler"},{"level":2,"text":"深处理器与浅处理器","id":"深处理器与浅处理器"},{"level":2,"text":"OCaml 5.5 的 effect 语法","id":"ocaml-5-5-的-effect-语法"},{"level":2,"text":"效果的组合性","id":"效果的组合性"},{"level":2,"text":"实现协程与生成器","id":"实现协程与生成器"},{"level":2,"text":"discontinue：中止计算","id":"discontinue-中止计算"},{"level":2,"text":"Effect Handler 与其他控制流机制的关系","id":"effect-handler-与其他控制流机制的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多核域与纤程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/concurrency-effects/multicore-domains-fibers"},"next":{"title":"异步 IO 与 Eio","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/concurrency-effects/async-io-eio"}}